  "title": "Northwind Supplies (Mexico entity): Q3 2025 quarterly finance memo, draft",
  "context": "Draft quarterly memo written by the finance analyst for the CFO and the regional managing director, to be circulated to the board pack. All figures are meant to come from the two ledger exports in the appendix: the 2025 general-ledger export and the export from the legacy ERP for the second half of 2024.",
  "claims": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "text": "Gross margin was 35.8% in Q3 2025 and stayed above 30% in every month of 2025 to date.",
      "refs": [
        "L1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "text": "Gross margin for Q3 2025 was 35.8%.",
      "refs": [
        "L1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "text": "The Q3 2025 average ticket was $6,284.97, and each month of Q3 had an average ticket above $3,500.",
      "refs": [
        "L1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "text": "Q3 2025 revenue came in below Q2 2025 revenue.",
      "refs": [
        "L1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "text": "Refunds were 6.8% of sales in Q3 2025 and stayed under 10% of sales in every month of 2025.",
      "refs": [
        "L1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "text": "Days sales outstanding improved to 41 days in Q3 2025.",
