      "text": "Operating expenses in Q3 2025 were $21,400.",
      "refs": [
        "L1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "text": "Monthly revenue exceeded $20,000 in August and September 2025 and has stayed above $20,000 every month since January 2025.",
      "refs": [
        "L1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "text": "Refunds were 7.4% of sales in Q2 2025.",
      "refs": [
        "L1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "text": "Revenue grew 33.0% from Q1 to Q2 2025.",
